caster to the targeted cell, and steals Dodge and health from enemies in the caster's best element in an area of effect."},{"id":23750,"name":"Muspel","element":"fire","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12620-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":4,"minRange":1,"maxRange":63,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":25,"effects":[{"element":"fire","min":18,"max":21,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":8,"max":0,"kind":"spell_buff","spellId":23750,"stack":0,"turns":0,"deathReset":true}],"critEffects":[{"element":"fire","min":22,"max":25,"kind":"damage"}]},{"grade":2,"ap":4,"minRange":1,"maxRange":63,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":25,"effects":[{"element":"fire","min":24,"max":28,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":10,"max":0,"kind":"spell_buff","spellId":23750,"stack":0,"turns":0,"deathReset":true}],"critEffects":[{"element":"fire","min":29,"max":33,"kind":"damage"}]},{"grade":3,"ap":4,"minRange":1,"maxRange":63,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":25,"effects":[{"element":"fire","min":28,"max":32,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":12,"max":0,"kind":"spell_buff","spellId":23750,"stack":0,"turns":0,"deathReset":true}],"critEffects":[{"element":"fire","min":34,"max":38,"kind":"damage"}]}],"description":"Increases the spell's damage for each enemy in the area of effect and inflicts Fire damage on them in an area of effect.\n\nThe spell can only be cast on the Lance and recalls it if the caster is Disarmed."},{"id":23723,"name":"Ydra","element":"earth","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12616-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":4,"minRange":0,"maxRange":0,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":25,"effects":[{"element":"earth","min":44,"max":50,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"earth","min":53,"max":60,"kind":"damage"}]}],"description":"Reduces damage suffered by the caster for each enemy in the area of effect and inflicts Earth damage on the enemies in an area of effect.\nThe area-of-effect damage does not decrease with distance.\n\nThe spell can only be cast on the Lance and recalls it if the caster is Disarmed."},{"id":23841,"name":"Iron Prelude","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12593-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":2,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Effect duration: -1","100 Power (2T)"]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":2,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Effect duration: -1","150 Power (2T)"]},{"grade":3,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":2,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Effect duration: -1","200 Power (2T)"]}],"description":"Reduces the duration of effects on enemies and increases allies' Power in an area of effect.\n\nIf the caster is Disarmed, the spell can only be cast on the Lance."},{"id":23842,"name":"Twilight","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12617-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":2,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":20,"max":0,"kind":"erosion","turns":2}],"buffs":["-3 Range (2T)"]}],"description":"Erodes and removes Range from enemies in an area of effect.\n\nIf the caster is Disarmed, the spell can only be cast on the Lance."},{"id":23738,"name":"Middle Earth","element":"earth","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12598-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":0,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":15,"effects":[{"element":"earth","min":22,"max":25,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"earth","min":27,"max":30,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["30 Power (2T)"]},{"grade":2,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":0,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":15,"effects":[{"element":"earth","min":27,"max":30,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"earth","min":32,"max":36,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["40 Power (2T)"]},{"grade":3,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":0,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":15,"effects":[{"element":"earth","min":30,"max":34,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"earth","min":36,"max":41,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["50 Power (2T)"]}],"description":"Increases the caster's Power for each enemy in the area of effect and inflicts Earth damage on the enemies in an area of effect.\n\nIf the caster is Disarmed, the spell can only be cast on the Lance."},{"id":23743,"name":"Disengaging","element":"air","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12605-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":4,"minRange":0,"maxRange":0,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":20,"effects":[{"element":"air","min":29,"max":32,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":4,"max":4,"kind":"push"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"air","min":35,"max":38,"kind":"damage"}]}],"description":"Inflicts Air damage on enemies and pushes targets back from the centre in an area of effect.\nDoes not affect the caster.\n\nThe spell can only be cast on the Lance and recalls it if the caster is Disarmed."},{"id":23826,"name":"Chivalry","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12595-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":0,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":5,"max":0,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":2,"max":2,"kind":"mp_gain"}]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":0,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":7,"max":0,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":2,"max":2,"kind":"mp_gain"}]}],"description":"Heals allies and increases their MP in an area of effect. \n\nAlso recalls the Lance if the caster is Disarmed."},{"id":23319,"name":"Renown","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12619-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":7,"max":0,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":7,"max":0,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["Attracts by 2 cell"]}],"description":"Attracts the target and heals the caster and the targeted ally.\nAttracts the target towards the Lance if the caster is Disarmed.\n\nAlso recalls the Lance if it is targeted."},{"id":23268,"name":"Jormun","element":"water","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12596-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":8,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":15,"effects":[{"element":"water","min":24,"max":27,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"water","min":21,"max":24,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"water","min":29,"max":33,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"water","min":25,"max":29,"kind":"damage"}]},{"grade":2,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":9,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":15,"effects":[{"element":"water","min":30,"max":34,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"water","min":26,"max":30,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"water","min":36,"max":41,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"water","min":31,"max":36,"kind":"damage"}]}],"description":"Inflicts Water damage on enemies in an area of effect up to the Lance.\n\nOn the caster: inflicts weaker Water damage on enemies in an area of effect around the caster and the Lance.\nThe area-of-effect damage does not decrease with distance and is only applied once per casting.\n\nAlso recalls the Lance."},{"id":23756,"name":"Hot Iron","element":"fire","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12606-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":5,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":15,"effects":[{"element":"fire","min":30,"max":34,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"fire","min":36,"max":41,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["x107% damage sustained"]}],"description":"Inflicts Fire damage on enemies and increases the damage they suffer in an area of effect.\nSummons the Lance if the cell is or becomes free.\n\nIf the caster is Disarmed, the spell can only be cast on the Lance."},{"id":23401,"name":"Puncheon","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12597-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":3,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["100 Lock (1T)","100% Vitality (1T)"]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":4,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["100 Lock (1T)","100% Vitality (1T)"]}],"description":"Recalls and summons the Lance in the Puncheon state:\n• Allows the Lance to lock.\n• Increases its Lock and Vitality.\n• Makes the Lance and targets adjacent to it Unmovable.\nThe effects are removed when the Lance is destroyed.\n\nOn the caster: makes only targets Unmovable in an area of effect."},{"id":23838,"name":"Valkyr's Embrace","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12621-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":10,"max":0,"kind":"erosion","turns":1}]}],"description":"Reduces damage suffered by the targeted ally and applies the Valkyr's Embrace state on the ally:\n• Erodes the target's enemy attackers."},{"id":23735,"name":"Noa","element":"air","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12622-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":4,"minRange":0,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":25,"effects":[{"element":"air","min":19,"max":21,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"air","min":21,"max":23,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"air","min":22,"max":25,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"air","min":25,"max":28,"kind":"damage"}]},{"grade":2,"ap":4,"minRange":0,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":25,"effects":[{"element":"air","min":23,"max":26,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"air","min":26,"max":29,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"air","min":28,"max":31,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"air","min":31,"max":35,"kind":"damage"}]}],"description":"Inflicts Air damage on enemies and applies the Noa state on them in an area of effect:\n• Inflicts Air damage and removes the state if the target suffers pushback damage.\nThe area-of-effect damage does not decrease with distance.\n\nIf the caster is Disarmed, the spell can only be cast on the Lance."},{"id":23396,"name":"Elding","element":"water","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12618-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":4,"minRange":1,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":25,"effects":[{"element":"water","min":36,"max":40,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"water","min":43,"max":48,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["Attracts by 2 cell"]}],"description":"Summons the Lance, attracts targets towards the centre and inflicts Water damage on enemies in an area of effect.\nDoes not affect the caster."},{"id":23834,"name":"Eclipse","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12599-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":5,"minRange":0,"maxRange":8,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":25,"effects":[],"buffs":["200% of level to shield (2T)","-6 Range (1T)"]},{"grade":2,"ap":5,"minRange":0,"maxRange":10,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":25,"effects":[],"buffs":["200% of level to shield (2T)","-6 Range (1T)"]}],"description":"Recalls the Lance, applies a shield on the caster and their allies in an area of effect around the caster, and removes Range from everyone.\n\nImmediately disarms the caster to apply effects on the targeted cell on the following turn:\n• Casts the Mani's Crescent spell if the cell is occupied by the caster.\n• Otherwise, casts the Sigel's Disc spell."},{"id":23846,"name":"Holmgang","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12623-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":4,"minRange":0,"maxRange":0,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["x65% damage sustained","Places a glyph-aura (2T)","Places a glyph-aura (1T)"]}],"description":"Recalls the Lance and replaces Guard with Holmgang:\n• Makes the caster Unmovable.\n• Reduces ranged damage suffered.\n• Places a glyph-aura that attracts enemies that cross or leave it and inflicts damage on them in the caster's best attack element (one time per enemy per turn).\n\nEnds the caster's current turn."}]}